A||N||4||Black88GT||Identifying a Getrag with 3.94 final drive||||1||
Z||000000||Black88GT||10-31-2000||10:20 PM||||A guy I know is parting out a beretta GTZ.  He is not sure how to check for the 3.94 FD Getrag so I asked him to send me every number on the thing to try and positively ID it.  So here they are, can someone help??<P>&lt;&lt; OK heres the #'s off the id tag<BR>in bold on the left 1XEX top right 8672256 muncie and finally above the bar code 611XEXM000814. My factory service manaul says it is a 5TM40. If thats not right or need any more let me know. &gt;&gt;<P><BR>???<P><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||1
Z||000001||PJ||10-31-2000||11:54 PM||||I don't know about the numbers but I can check the case and paperwork I have at the shop tomorrow. The Getrag with the 3.94 was used in A body cars, Grand Am, Beretta, and Achieva, around '93 & '94. It was mated to a Quad Four. They also used an hydraulic throw-out bearing. If I remember correctly all the internal parts fit into the Fiero case with the exception of the reverse fork rail. You will also need to change the speedo gear on the diff if you want accurate dash info.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Black88GT||11-01-2000||11:35 AM||||Thanks PJ, I appreciate it.  I thought maybe Rodney would have some info. also.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||14
Z||000003||PJ||11-01-2000||06:18 PM||||Jeff,<P>The label on my case (came out of an '93 Grand Am) is as follows: 4XTX, 22591277MUNCIE, 614XTXMooo673. The 22591277 is the part #. The 35N parts catalog also designates the 3.94 ratio box as XTX not XEX. I'd put it in first gear (3.50) and turn the imput shaft and count revolutions at the diff to be sure. I'm lousy at math but I think 12.74 imput shaft revs to one diff rev is a 3.64. 13.79 revs is a 3.94.<P>PJ<BR>ITA #66 Black<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000004||Black88GT||11-01-2000||09:45 PM||||Oh well, thought I had found a diamond in the rough for a second<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD||||reg||9
